g:\u003c/strong\u003e Efficient cleaning pattern reduces cycle time.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFloor and Wall Cleaning:\u003c/strong\u003e Covers the entire pool surface up to the waterline.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOut-of-Water Sensor:\u003c/strong\u003e Protects the motor by shutting off if the unit drives out of the pool.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSimple Operation:\u003c/strong\u003e No hoses or hookups required.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$c\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Top-access filters are very convenient\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Solid build quality typical of Hayward\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Good floor and wall coverage\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Energy efficient operation\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Easy to maintain\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Struggles with aggressive waterline scrubbing\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"No swivel on the cable\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Heavier than comparable Dolphin models\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Filter cartridges can be pricey to replace\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Hayward SharkVac XL is one of the strongest options for pool owners who value reliability, simple maintenance, and proven cleaning performance. Its top-access filtration system significantly improves usability compared to earlier Hayward models, while Smart Steering technology provides effective floor and wall coverage without unnecessary complexity. Although it lacks premium features such as app connectivity, advanced mapping, and aggressive waterline scrubbing, it remains a dependable robotic cleaner that handles the core cleaning tasks exceptionally well. For buyers seeking a straightforward robotic pool cleaner from an established pool industry brand, the SharkVac XL remains a compelling choice.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Hayward SharkVac XL\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SR4M42F?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",